    <string name="streaming_footer">Saver asks the server for a smaller MP3 of each song as it plays; servers that can\'t make one send the original. Downloaded Only plays just what\'s on this device while on mobile data. With Data Saver on, streams are kept at 128 kbps. Wi-Fi and downloads always get the original file.</string>
    <string name="report_plays">Report Plays to the Server</string>
    <string name="report_plays_footer">Tells the server what\'s playing and counts plays: on Subsonic servers once you\'ve heard half a song or four minutes, on Jellyfin by its own rules. Plays made offline are sent later. The server can pass them on to Last.fm or ListenBrainz.</string>
